1002
00:50:25.605 --> 00:50:27.607
Medyo nakakatakot.

1003
00:50:28.191 --> 00:50:32.112
Naramdaman kong wala akong magawa,
nakagapos na parang pinaparusahan.

1004
00:50:32.696 --> 00:50:35.407
Ito ay magiging isang mahabang laban.

1005
00:50:36.491 --> 00:50:40.495
Ang ikaapat na paghahanap ng Pisikal: Asya.

1006
00:50:40.579 --> 00:50:41.830
Ang Death Match.

1007
00:50:42.581 --> 00:50:46.293
Ang 1,200-kg pillar push.

1008
00:50:48.003 --> 00:50:49.212
Stand by.

1009
00:50:51.798 --> 00:50:52.841
handa na…

1010
00:50:52.924 --> 00:50:54.134
Tama, dito na tayo.

1011
00:50:54.217 --> 00:50:55.135
Tingnan natin kung paano tayo pupunta.

1012
00:50:55.218 --> 00:50:57.095
-Ito ay 100 laps lamang.
-Oo, gawin natin ito.

1013
00:50:57.179 --> 00:50:58.722
Huwag lang hayaang bumaba ang bilis.

1014
00:51:08.607 --> 00:51:09.608
Tara na!

1015
00:51:14.196 --> 00:51:16.364
Tara na guys! Ang bilis naman!

1016
00:51:16.448 --> 00:51:18.074
Ito ang Death Match, guys!

1017
00:51:18.158 --> 00:51:19.993
Wala nang iba pagkatapos nito!

1018
00:51:29.920 --> 00:51:31.338
Hindi kami uuwi.

1019
